hadiths[22]{hadithnumber,text}:
"484","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Umra (zindagi bhar ke liye kisi ko cheez dena) us ke warison ke liye meeras hai. Ya woh us ke warison ke liye jaiz hai.'"
"485","[AI-translation] Shuraih ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne umra ke bare mein fatwa diya ke woh jaiz hai."
"486","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Umra jaiz hai.'"
"487","[AI-translation] Qatadah (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Hasan (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Woh kahte the: Umra jaiz hai."
"488","[AI-translation] Imam Zuhri (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Umra yeh hai ke aadmi kahe: 'Yeh us ke liye hai, aur us ke baad us ki aulad ke liye.' To woh us ke liye hai jis ke liye us ne shart lagai."
"489","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Umra jaiz hai.'"
"490","[AI-translation] Imam Zuhri (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Khulafa is muamle ka faisla karte the. Ata (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Abdul Malik bin Marwan ne is muamle ka faisla kiya."
"491","[AI-translation] Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Umra jaiz hai.'"
"492","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jise baghair mange kuch diya jae aur woh use qabool kare to woh rizq hai jo Allah ne us ki taraf bheja hai.'"
"493","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe dast ka tohfa diya jae to main use qabool karunga. Aur agar mujhe pae ki da'wat di jae to main us da'wat ko bhi qabool karunga.'"
"494","[AI-translation] A'sham (Rahimahullah) ne isi sanad se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat ki."
"495","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe dast ke gosht ka tohfa diya jae to main use qabool karunga.' Jareer (Rahimahullah) ne kaha: Mera khayal hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Agar mujhe dast ke gosht ki da'wat di jae to main use qabool karunga.'"
"496","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala us kutte ki manind hai jo khata rahta hai yahan tak ke sair ho jata hai, phir qai karta hai, phir apni qai khane lagta hai.'"
"497","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Jab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apne ghar ke siwa kisi ghar mein khana pesh kiya jata to Aap poochte: 'Kya yeh tohfa hai ya sadaqa?' Phir agar kaha jata ke woh sadaqa hai to Aap us mein se na khate, lekin Aap ke sahaba khate. Aur agar kaha jata ke woh tohfa hai to Aap us mein se khate."
"498","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala us kutte ki manind hai jo qai kare phir use chaate.'"
"499","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala us kutte ki manind hai jo qai kare phir use chaate.'"
"500","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kisi ke liye halal nahin ke woh tohfa de phir us mein wapas aae, siwae walid ke jo apne bachche ko kuch de. Us shakhs ki misal jo tohfa de phir us mein wapas aae us kutte ki si hai jo qai kare phir use chaate.'"
"501","[AI-translation] Tawus (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Kisi ke liye halal nahin ke woh tohfa de phir us mein wapas aae, siwae walid ke (woh jo apne bachche ko diya us mein wapas aa sakta hai).'"
"502","[AI-translation] Ata (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala us ki manind hai jo apni qai chaate.'"
"503","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Jab tum mein se kisi ko tohfa diya jae jabke us ke sath kuch log hazir hon to woh bhi us mein shareek hain.'"
"504","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Hamare liye buri misal nahin hai (ham un mein se nahin honge jo is misal se bayan kiye gae); apne tohfe mein wapas aane wala us kutte ki manind hai jo qai kare phir use chaate.'"
"505","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Abbas (Raziyallahu anhuma) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se pichli hadees ki manind riwayat hai."
